{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10136180","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10136180","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1013618001:3":{"text":"萨基塔里斯大人！您为什么在这里！","source_cn":"萨基塔里斯大人！您为什么在这里！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6E03C9D6B633429","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1013618002:1":{"text":"我来得巧了。或者说，不太巧？","source_cn":"我来得巧了。或者说，不太巧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5DB8FBA5A7A5F7FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1013618003:1":{"text":"呵，真该带上我的竖琴的。此时此刻的情节，不觉得正适合伴奏一曲吗？","source_cn":"呵，真该带上我的竖琴的。此时此刻的情节，不觉得正适合伴...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CFB40CD276730D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1013618004:2":{"text":"……唔啊！什、什么声音！","source_cn":"……唔啊！什、什么声音！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE181B2A84E24FE5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1013618005:1":{"text":"是、是谁把满满吵醒了！","source_cn":"是、是谁把满满吵醒了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44EDD23EF402D39A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1013618006:2":{"text":"发出声音的是——咦，阿塔兰忒？你、你不是被送回圣石镇了吗，怎么会出现在这里？","source_cn":"发出声音的是——咦，阿塔兰忒？你、你不是被送回圣石镇了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10A06B143E27F8E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1013618007:1":{"text":"当然要在场了。她可是这场人间喜剧重要的女主角。","source_cn":"当然要在场了。她可是这场人间喜剧重要的女主角。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0793206A2247B823","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1013618008:1":{"text":"啊？喜剧？什么喜剧……说话的居然是萨基塔里斯阁下！","source_cn":"啊？喜剧？什么喜剧……说话的居然是萨基塔里斯阁下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10B538380C8B8CD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1013618009:0":{"text":"自然因为我也是这场喜剧重要的观众。","source_cn":"自然因为我也是这场喜剧重要的观众。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA88CC7286CBD19A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1013618009":{"text":"自然因为我也是这场喜剧重要的观众。","source_cn":"自然因为我也是这场喜剧重要的观众。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA88CC7286CBD19A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1013618010:0":{"text":"喜剧并不一定全然是欢笑。但艾雅在上，总不会放任此事变成悲剧。","source_cn":"喜剧并不一定全然是欢笑。但艾雅在上，总不会放任此事变成悲剧。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":